{
  "rationale": "The plant automata model the robot's motion capabilities and perception outcomes. The specification automata bind sensor outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative obstacle recovery, and prevent unsafe or oscillatory behaviors. Recovery states are brief and only escalate to full_rotate if repeated blockages occur. Forward and random_walk are prioritized in clear states for coverage.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect open-loop actuation and asynchronous sensing.",
    "Specification automata bind perception to safe actions, enforce conservative recovery, and prevent repeated or unsafe behaviors (e.g., no repeated rotate, no direct full_rotate except as last resort, no move_backward except in dedicated recovery)."
  ],
